    <criterion testable="true">Ephemeral artifacts archived per `/repo-cleanup`; permanent artifacts retained.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A final `code-review` has run with Critical findings addressed; `current-task.md` set to "none — project complete".</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Main-session only (root §3). The `/test-diet` gate is mandatory per root §7 — skipping is a HARD WARNING that must be justified in the PR. After this task, run `merge-to-master`.
